window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A marriage that could save them both. A truth that might destroy them.</p> <p>And a choice that will break her heart.</p> <p>All Aika ever wanted was a family—until hers was standing on opposite ends of a war. Trapped between her loyalty to a monster and her love for a man who despises her, she must decide who she's willing to lose.</p> <p>And who she's willing to betray.</p> <p>Don't miss this dark Cinderella retelling, where the stroke of midnight could mean the end of everything.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
